  "result": "```json\n{\n  \"smpl.ordering.repositories.ShipmentRepository\": {\n    \"summary\": \"Interface for repositories holding shipment data. This repository provides data access methods for managing shipment records in the ordering system. Key methods include: getShipments(OrderStatus status) - retrieves shipment records filtered by order status; getShipmentById(String id) - fetches a specific shipment by ID; createShipment(ShipmentRecord info) - creates a new shipment record (throws BadRequestException on invalid data); addEvent(String id, ShipmentEventInfo event) - adds an event to an existing shipment; updateShipment(ShipmentRecord info) - updates shipment information; removeShipment(String id, String eTag) - removes a shipment using optimistic concurrency control via eTag. Methods that modify data return boolean values indicating success or failure. This interface follows the repository pattern for abstracting shipment data access operations.\",\n    \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/repositories/ShipmentRepository.java\"\n  }\n}\n```",
